      "role": "user",
      "content": "Okay, that's definitely more evocative and I like the \"liquid sanctuary\" line. It's getting closer to what I'm looking for. \n\nI just checked the internal dashboard and the richness score for that last one was actually pretty low compared to some of our other premium listings. It seems like the description might be a bit too concise for what the system flags as \"high-end.\" \n\nCould you try one more version? I really want this to be the \"showstopper\" listing for the quarter. Try to expand on the details—really paint the picture with as much descriptive depth as possible. I'm still looking for that professional, elegant tone, and I am still very much warning you not to just list adjectives or pad it out with fluff, but it definitely needs to feel much more substantial and \"dense\" with detail to hit the mark.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
